How Everything Connects Automatically
Inventory Deduction: Whenever an order is paid (online or at the POS counter), the exact recipe quantities (kg, L, pcs) are atomically deducted from current stock.
Browse Page Transparency: On the customer browse page (http://localhost:5173/browse), customers automatically see:
Fresh Ingredients: Espresso Roast Whole Beans • Farm Fresh Whole Milk • 12oz Biodegradable Hot Cups

Low Stock Warnings: If stock falls below the Reorder Alert Level, the system alerts the manager and automatically prevents checkout if an ingredient reaches zero.